我可以给你送过去吗？

1330
01:03:33.300 --> 01:03:35.700
I said, oh my gosh, Joya, yes.
我说，天哪，乔亚，太好了。

1331
01:03:35.920 --> 01:03:41.000
So we met for coffee and we caught up 15 years of life and marriage and kids.
于是我们约了咖啡，聊了聊过去15年里的生活、婚姻和孩子。

1332
01:03:41.220 --> 01:03:44.640
And Jenna, she opened up her trunk and it was full of bobbleheads.
珍娜，她打开后备箱，里面全是摇头娃娃。

1333
01:03:44.880 --> 01:03:47.220
I took a picture of her standing by her trunk.
我拍了一张她站在后备箱旁边的照片。

1334
01:03:47.400 --> 01:03:50.480
I now have all of these bobbleheads.
我现在拥有了所有这些摇头娃娃。

1335
01:03:50.960 --> 01:03:54.560
That is so crazy because, you know, when we were going through all of our bins of stuff
这太疯狂了，因为你知道，当我们整理书里用的那些旧物箱时，

1336
01:03:54.560 --> 01:04:02.020
for the book, I found an Oscar bobblehead and a Jim bobblehead and a Pam bobblehead
我找到了奥斯卡的摇头娃娃，还有吉姆、帕姆的摇头娃娃，

1337
01:04:02.020 --> 01:04:04.340
and a Dwight bobblehead.
以及德怀特的摇头娃娃。

1338
01:04:04.480 --> 01:04:05.240
That's all I have.
我就只有这些。

