1492
01:11:27.030 --> 01:11:32.890
At 14 minutes, 46 seconds, the graphics for the laptop battery boxes were created by our
在14分46秒时，笔记本电池盒的图形是由我们的

1493
01:11:32.890 --> 01:11:36.110
graphic designer, Henry Sane, and packaged up by Phil Shea.
平面设计师亨利·塞恩制作的，并由菲尔·谢包装。

1494
01:11:36.530 --> 01:11:37.230
Fakie batteries.
假电池。

1495
01:11:37.490 --> 01:11:38.170
Fakie battery.
假电池。

1496
01:11:38.830 --> 01:11:42.150
Well, back at the office, Jim's about to have his own cringe moment.
回到办公室，吉姆也要迎来他自己的尴尬时刻了。

1497
01:11:42.570 --> 01:11:46.910
I love how they edited these scenes because you go from Michael being in hot water to Jim
我喜欢他们剪辑这些场景的方式，因为你从迈克尔陷入困境的画面，直接转到了吉姆

1498
01:11:46.910 --> 01:11:47.810
being in hot water.
陷入困境的画面。

1499
01:11:47.990 --> 01:11:48.370
Yes.
没错。

1500
01:11:48.870 --> 01:11:51.910
Jim is going to announce the employee of the month.
吉姆要宣布月度最佳员工了。

1501
01:11:52.330 --> 01:11:55.710
According to this data, it's employee number nine.
根据这份数据，是九号员工。

1502
01:11:55.710 --> 01:11:57.550
Who is employee number nine?
九号员工是谁？

1503
01:11:57.730 --> 01:11:58.550
It's Jim.
是吉姆。

1504
01:11:58.890 --> 01:11:59.530
Oh, boy.
天哪。

1505
01:11:59.750 --> 01:12:01.930
People are instantly furious.
大家瞬间就怒了。

1506
01:12:02.270 --> 01:12:05.110
They don't even take a beat to be like, oh, maybe there was an error.
他们甚至连停顿一下，想说“哦，也许是搞错了”的时间都没有。

1507
01:12:05.250 --> 01:12:06.830
No, they're instantly like, you.
不，他们直接就说：就是你。

1508
01:12:06.830 --> 01:12:07.070
Ew.
咦。

1509
01:12:07.570 --> 01:12:09.130
Yes, Jim won $1,000.
没错，吉姆赢了一千美元。

1510
01:12:09.830 --> 01:12:11.490
Yeah, and got his own parking spot.
是啊，还得到了专属停车位。

1511
01:12:11.910 --> 01:12:12.850
Oh, my gosh.
天呐。

1512
01:12:12.870 --> 01:12:13.730
He's like, no, no, no.
他当时说，不，不，不。

1513
01:12:13.830 --> 01:12:15.530
This is obviously a mistake.
这显然是个错误。

1514
01:12:16.090 --> 01:12:17.450
Who's second on the list?
名单上第二名是谁？

1515
01:12:17.610 --> 01:12:19.330
We need the second person on the liSt.
我们需要名单上的第二个人。

1516
01:12:20.050 --> 01:12:20.710
Uh-oh.
糟了。

1517
01:12:21.170 --> 01:12:22.750
It's Jim's wife, Pam.
是吉姆的妻子，帕姆。

1518
01:12:23.090 --> 01:12:23.950
Oh, boy.
天哪。

1519
01:12:24.350 --> 01:12:26.010
How is that even possible?
这怎么可能呢？

1520
01:12:26.810 --> 01:12:30.250
But Pam is going to defend herself as the winner.
但帕姆打算为自己作为赢家辩护。

1521
01:12:30.790 --> 01:12:30.930
Yeah.
是啊。

1522
01:12:30.930 --> 01:12:31.790
She's like, no, wait.
她说，不，等等。

1523
01:12:31.910 --> 01:12:32.290
Come on.
拜托。

1524
01:12:32.370 --> 01:12:33.170
I didn't miss a date.
我没错过任何日期。

1525
01:12:33.350 --> 01:12:34.030
I came in early.
我早早来上班。

1526
01:12:34.150 --> 01:12:34.770
I stayed late.
我加班到很晚。

1527
01:12:34.910 --> 01:12:36.670
And I doubled my sales last month.
而且我上个月的销售额翻了一番。

1528
01:12:36.810 --> 01:12:37.110
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1529
01:12:37.470 --> 01:12:38.530
Andy goes, oh, really?
安迪说，哦，真的吗？

1530
01:12:38.670 --> 01:12:38.990
From what?
从多少翻到多少？

1531
01:12:39.090 --> 01:12:39.610
Two to four?
从两单到四单？

1532
01:12:40.050 --> 01:12:40.430
Yep.
没错。

1533
01:12:41.030 --> 01:12:42.670
That is one of your most famous memes.
那是你最著名的表情包之一。

1534
01:12:43.170 --> 01:12:44.730
I have texted it to people.
我给别人发过这个表情包。

1535
01:12:45.030 --> 01:12:47.230
I have texted my own meme to people.
我甚至给自己发过我自己的表情包。

1536
01:12:47.430 --> 01:12:47.770
The yup.
就是那个“没错”。

1537
01:12:47.950 --> 01:12:50.170
I have texted an Angela eye roll to people.
我给别人发过安吉拉翻白眼的表情包。

1538
01:12:50.890 --> 01:12:51.630
My own meme.
我自己的表情包。

1539
01:12:51.630 --> 01:12:53.470
I see that yup everywhere, Jenna.
我到处都能看到那个“没错”，珍娜。

1540
01:12:53.770 --> 01:12:54.190
I know.
我知道。

1541
01:12:54.330 --> 01:12:55.250
And it's so perfect.
而且它太完美了。

1542
01:12:55.490 --> 01:12:56.590
It made me laugh.
它把我逗笑了。

1543
01:12:56.750 --> 01:12:59.330
Even though I know it, it still made me laugh.
尽管我早就知道这个梗，它还是把我逗笑了。

1544
01:12:59.490 --> 01:13:01.590
It made me laugh while I was doing it.
我在做那个表情的时候自己就笑场了。

1545
01:13:01.750 --> 01:13:07.130
You'd be surprised how difficult it was to get just one word without me breaking.
你可能想不到，只说一个词而不笑场有多难。

1546
01:13:07.550 --> 01:13:07.950
Yup.
没错。

1547
01:13:08.410 --> 01:13:08.810
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1548
01:13:09.330 --> 01:13:10.930
Well, it's going to get even worse.
好吧，情况还会变得更糟。

1549
01:13:11.090 --> 01:13:15.830
You think it can't get worse for Jim, but now there's going to be a cake delivered with his face on it.
你以为吉姆的情况不会更糟了，但现在要送来一个印着他脸的蛋糕。

1550
01:13:16.010 --> 01:13:17.870
This was a real cake, you guys.
伙计们，这可是个真蛋糕。

1551
01:13:18.050 --> 01:13:19.690
We actually ate this cake.
我们真的吃了这个蛋糕。

1552
01:13:19.810 --> 01:13:20.150
We did.
确实吃了。

1553
01:13:20.150 --> 01:13:21.570
I had a slice of it.
我吃了一块。

1554
01:13:21.890 --> 01:13:23.110
It was delicious.
味道好极了。

1555
01:13:23.670 --> 01:13:27.550
It was a real distorted angle of John's face.
那张照片里约翰的脸角度真的很扭曲。

1556
01:13:27.750 --> 01:13:28.590
It was a little bit.
确实有点。

1557
01:13:28.630 --> 01:13:32.730
It was like when someone takes a photo of you and they go, like, chin up.
就像有人给你拍照时说，把下巴抬起来那样。

1558
01:13:33.990 --> 01:13:38.170
I actually had my camera on set that day, and I took a picture of the cake.
那天我在片场正好带着相机，就拍了一张蛋糕的照片。

1559
01:13:38.310 --> 01:13:39.450
I'll put it in stories.
我会把它发到快拍里。

1560
01:13:40.310 --> 01:13:48.270
The cake delivery man was played by Charlie Sanders, who is a writer, actor, and co-producer of Key and Peele,
送蛋糕的人是由查理·桑德斯饰演的，他是一位编剧、演员，也是《基和皮尔》的联合制片人，

1561
01:13:48.510 --> 01:13:53.490
for which he was nominated for an Emmy for Outstanding Writing three years in a row.
他凭借该剧连续三年获得了艾美奖最佳编剧提名。

1562
01:13:53.850 --> 01:13:55.050
I love Key and Peele.
我超爱《基和皮尔》。

1563
01:13:55.310 --> 01:13:55.730
Me too.
我也是。

1564
01:13:56.130 --> 01:13:56.650
Oh, my God.
天呐。

1565
01:13:56.650 --> 01:13:57.470
It cracks me up.
他们总是让我笑得停不下来。

1566
01:13:57.570 --> 01:13:58.750
We hung out with Key and Peele.
我们和基和皮尔一起玩过。

1567
01:13:58.790 --> 01:13:59.250
We did.
确实。

1568
01:13:59.390 --> 01:14:01.250
We were on a private plane with them.
我们和他们一起坐过私人飞机。

1569
01:14:01.330 --> 01:14:03.090
The only time I've ever been on a private plane.
那是我唯一一次坐私人飞机。

1570
01:14:03.090 --> 01:14:03.930
Well, same.
我也是。

1571
01:14:04.890 --> 01:14:05.410
Yes.
没错。

1572
01:14:05.610 --> 01:14:10.710
Caesar Palace flew Jenna and Keegan and Jordan to play in this poker tournament.
凯撒皇宫酒店当时邀请了珍娜、基根和乔丹去参加扑克锦标赛。

1573
01:14:10.910 --> 01:14:12.090
You took me as a plus one.
你带我作为你的随行人员一起去了。

1574
01:14:12.230 --> 01:14:13.750
They flew us to New Orleans.
他们用私人飞机把我们送到了新奥尔良。

1575
01:14:14.090 --> 01:14:18.950
We got on this private plane with these guys, and we played Euchre the whole plane ride.
我们和他们一起上了那架私人飞机，整个航程都在玩尤克牌。

1576
01:14:19.170 --> 01:14:20.510
I love Euchre.
我超爱尤克牌。

1577
01:14:20.670 --> 01:14:22.650
We couldn't believe other people knew Euchre.
我们当时简直不敢相信还有别人会玩尤克牌。

1578
01:14:22.990 --> 01:14:24.070
It's a card game.
那是一种纸牌游戏。

1579
01:14:24.230 --> 01:14:24.890
We love them.
我们很喜欢他们。

1580
01:14:24.950 --> 01:14:25.550
They're so fun.
他们太有趣了。

1581
01:14:26.110 --> 01:14:29.870
The cake is not the last thing on Dwight's list of diabolical plans.
蛋糕并不是德怀特邪恶计划清单上的最后一项。

1582
01:14:30.250 --> 01:14:30.770
No.
没错。

1583
01:14:30.990 --> 01:14:35.710
He riles everybody up, but it only works if people complain to David Wallace.
他煽动所有人，但只有当大家向大卫·华莱士投诉时才有效。

1584
01:14:36.090 --> 01:14:41.970
So Dwight starts calling David Wallace's office, pretending to be everyone else.
于是德怀特开始给大卫·华莱士的办公室打电话，假装成其他人。

1585
01:14:42.090 --> 01:14:43.210
It's so good.
这招太绝了。

1586
01:14:43.450 --> 01:14:45.890
I actually, I thought we needed to hear it.
我其实觉得我们有必要听听看。

1587
01:14:45.990 --> 01:14:51.510
He is going to leave messages as Kevin, as Stanley, and as Toby.
他会分别模仿凯文、斯坦利和托比留下语音留言。

1588
01:14:51.830 --> 01:14:54.990
I think my favorite part is, like, his body language.
我觉得最精彩的部分是他的肢体语言。

1589
01:14:54.990 --> 01:14:55.550
Changes.
一直在变。

1590
01:14:55.830 --> 01:15:00.710
As he's doing all the voice, he's, like, spinning his hair with his fingertip when he's being Toby.
他在模仿不同声音的时候，模仿托比时会用指尖绕着头发。

1591
01:15:01.010 --> 01:15:01.190
Yeah.
没错。

1592
01:15:01.310 --> 01:15:02.770
He's, like, all slumped on the ground.
他整个人瘫坐在地上。

1593
01:15:02.890 --> 01:15:03.090
Yeah.
是啊。

1594
01:15:03.450 --> 01:15:04.330
But here it is.
就在这儿。

1595
01:15:04.370 --> 01:15:05.110
You have to hear it.
你一定要听听。

1596
01:15:05.630 --> 01:15:07.390
This is Kevin Malone.
我是凯文·马龙。

1597
01:15:07.610 --> 01:15:08.670
Is David there?
大卫在吗？

1598
01:15:09.210 --> 01:15:10.690
No, he's on his weekly staff meeting.
不在，他正在开每周员工会议。

1599
01:15:10.770 --> 01:15:11.390
Can I take a message?
需要我转达什么吗？

1600
01:15:12.050 --> 01:15:18.370
Tell him I'm mad at Jim, because he's asking us to give money to pay him.
告诉他我很生吉姆的气，因为他要求我们出钱付给他。

1601
01:15:18.590 --> 01:15:20.490
This is Stanley Hudson.
我是斯坦利·哈德森。

1602
01:15:21.570 --> 01:15:23.970
Jim Halpert is a menace.
吉姆·哈珀特是个麻烦精。

1603
01:15:23.970 --> 01:15:25.730
It's Toby Flandersen.
是托比·弗兰德森。

1604
01:15:26.270 --> 01:15:29.330
Listen, things are getting really bad down here.
听着，下面情况真的很糟糕。

1605
01:15:30.450 --> 01:15:32.150
Those are so funny to me.
那些对我来说太搞笑了。

1606
01:15:32.910 --> 01:15:34.630
But, Jenna, there was one more.
但是，珍娜，还有一个。

1607
01:15:35.230 --> 01:15:36.050
There was?
真的吗？

1608
01:15:36.270 --> 01:15:36.530
Yes.
是的。

1609
01:15:36.790 --> 01:15:39.950
It didn't make it in the final cut, but it's in deleted scenes.
它没能进入最终剪辑，但在删减片段里。

1610
01:15:39.950 --> 01:15:43.750
It's a little R-rated, so maybe that's why it didn't make it.
它有点限制级，所以可能这就是它没能入选的原因。

1611
01:15:43.970 --> 01:15:47.670
Here is Dwight calling, pretending to be Meredith.
这是德怀特打来的电话，假装是梅雷迪思。

1612
01:15:48.490 --> 01:15:49.750
It's Meredith Palmer.
我是梅雷迪思·帕尔默。

1613
01:15:50.110 --> 01:15:59.370
Listen, kid, I'm going to be drunk as a skunk, and you don't know what to tell me about crotch injuries, but Jim Halpert is a f***ing prick.
听着，孩子，我到时候会醉得像只臭鼬，你不知道该怎么跟我说胯部受伤的事，但吉姆·哈珀特是个混蛋。

1614
01:16:01.250 --> 01:16:08.500
Oh, I was getting all of these messages.
哦，我当时收到了所有这些信息。

1615
01:16:09.720 --> 01:16:10.040
Yeah.
是啊。

1616
01:16:10.440 --> 01:16:13.880
Jim is definitely going to be hearing from David Wallace later.
吉姆之后肯定会收到大卫·华莱士的消息。

1617
01:16:13.880 --> 01:16:18.680
But back at the school, Michael and Erin are leaving.
回到学校那边，迈克尔和艾琳正要离开。

1618
01:16:19.020 --> 01:16:19.980
They are disgraced.
他们丢尽了脸面。

1619
01:16:20.520 --> 01:16:26.200
But as they're leaving, one of the students runs out and just kind of confronts Michael.
但就在他们离开时，其中一个学生跑出来，直接质问迈克尔。

1620
01:16:26.480 --> 01:16:27.200
He's like, dude.
他说，老兄。

1621
01:16:27.540 --> 01:16:27.960
Yeah.
是啊。

1622
01:16:28.520 --> 01:16:30.580
This is, like, really messed up.
这真的太过分了。

1623
01:16:30.620 --> 01:16:35.000
And Michael just apologizes again, and he says, you know what?
迈克尔再次道歉，他说，你知道吗？

1624
01:16:35.080 --> 01:16:36.520
I'll pay for your books.
我会支付你的书本费。

1625
01:16:36.600 --> 01:16:37.860
It's the least I can do.
这是我唯一能做的了。

1626
01:16:38.080 --> 01:16:38.320
Yeah.
是啊。

1627
01:16:38.740 --> 01:16:41.440
And he's like, okay, well, books are like $1,000.
他说，好吧，书本费大概要1000美元。

1628
01:16:42.040 --> 01:16:42.920
I mean, that's a lot.
我是说，那可是一大笔钱。

1629
01:16:43.200 --> 01:16:45.920
And Michael's like, that's like, oh, $200 a year.
迈克尔说，那大概是，哦，一年200美元。

1630
01:16:45.920 --> 01:16:49.520
And the kid's like, it's $1,000 a year.
那个孩子说，是一年1000美元。

1631
01:16:49.780 --> 01:16:52.000
So Michael writes a few checks for $1,000.
于是迈克尔开了几张1000美元的支票。

1632
01:16:52.300 --> 01:16:54.560
He says, please notify me before you cash these.
他说，兑现前请通知我。

1633
01:16:54.700 --> 01:16:56.340
I have to move some money around.
我得调动一下资金。

1634
01:16:57.260 --> 01:16:57.780
Yes.
是的。

1635
01:16:57.900 --> 01:17:01.840
And he has to hold them for, like, a couple of years, each one per year.
而且他得把这些支票留着，大概留几年，每年兑现一张。

1636
01:17:02.260 --> 01:17:06.100
Well, listen, the actor who played the student is so good.
嗯，听着，饰演那个学生的演员演得太好了。

1637
01:17:06.100 --> 01:17:08.040
His name is Kwame Boateng.
他的名字叫夸梅·博阿滕。

1638
01:17:08.320 --> 01:17:12.140
He is part of a trio, an acting trio.
他是三人组的一员，一个表演三人组。

1639
01:17:12.140 --> 01:17:14.700
His brothers, they're referred to as the K brothers.
他的兄弟们被称为K兄弟。

1640
01:17:15.400 --> 01:17:16.460
He's amazing.
他太棒了。

1641
01:17:16.460 --> 01:17:18.600
He did a bunch of films and television.
他拍过很多电影和电视剧。

1642
01:17:18.600 --> 01:17:23.700
But now he is actually the CEO of his own company called the Boateng Group.
但现在他实际上是他自己公司——博阿滕集团的首席执行官。

1643
01:17:24.340 --> 01:17:24.920
Yeah.
是啊。

1644
01:17:25.520 --> 01:17:28.120
So he's kind of moving and shaking in the business world now.
所以他现在在商界也算是风生水起。

1645
01:17:28.580 --> 01:17:32.880
And we also had a fan catch in this scene from Matthew in Franklin, Indiana.
我们还有一位来自印第安纳州富兰克林的粉丝马修在这一幕中发现了一个细节。

1646
01:17:33.240 --> 01:17:37.900
At 16 minutes, 48 seconds, you can see snow outside the school.
在16分48秒时，你可以看到学校外面有雪。

1647
01:17:38.100 --> 01:17:38.520
Oh, yeah.
哦，没错。

1648
01:17:38.660 --> 01:17:39.280
Fakie snow.
假雪。

1649
01:17:39.280 --> 01:17:43.900
Well, that fakie snow was provided by our special effects technician, Mike Thompson.
嗯，那场假雪是由我们的特效技师迈克·汤普森提供的。

1650
01:17:44.580 --> 01:17:49.940
According to Randy Cordray, it was actually a warm and sunny day in Van Nuys, about 75 degrees.
据兰迪·科德雷说，那天在范奈斯其实是个温暖晴朗的日子，气温大约75华氏度。

1651
